# ZERO1 Learn & Play — environment template
# Copy to `.env` for local overrides. Vite only exposes keys prefixed with VITE_.
# This project currently needs no secrets at build or runtime (static SPA).
# Do not put production credentials, API tokens, or private keys here.

# Example (unused today — reserved for a future progress/analytics API):
# VITE_PROGRESS_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
# VITE_ANALYTICS_ID=
